Note on scope: this repository contains original build recipes and metadata
(bitbake .bb/.bbappend/.conf files, and the Python applications under
meta-uconsole-sdr) authored for this project. It does not vendor the source
code of the third-party software those recipes fetch and build (Yocto/OpenEmbedded
layers, the Linux kernel, Qt, GNU Radio, rtl_433, and similar). Each such
project is fetched from its own upstream repository at build time and remains
under its own license (predominantly GPL-2.0, LGPL, and BSD/MIT-family
licenses; see the LICENSE field of each recipe for specifics). This MIT grant
covers only the original files in this repository.
